{"text": "Geppetto lived in a small, poor room that got its light from under a staircase. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the wall there was a fireplace, but it was only a painting of one. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He picked up his tools and said, I will call my puppet Pinocchio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This name will bring him luck, he said to himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He carved the hair, the forehead, and then the eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To his surprise, the eyes moved and stared right at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next he carved the nose, which began to grow and grow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The more Geppetto cut it, the longer the nose became. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he finished the mouth, it began to laugh at him and stuck out its tongue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the puppets new hands snatched the yellow wig from Geppettos head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You naughty boy, You are not even finished, and you already do not respect your father. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Geppetto made the feet, they kicked him right on the nose.", "alignment": {"characters": ["G", "e", "p", "p", "e", "t", "t", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "g", "o", "t", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "a", "i", "r", "c", "a", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "p", "a", "i", "n", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "f", " ", "o", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i",